app is a page
    name is "app"
.
t is a text box
    name is "t"
.
label is a text
    text is "x"
.
put t, label in app
when t changed
    value of label is "typed"
    width of label is 200
    height of label is "50%"
    foreground of label is "red"
    title of label is "T"
    tooltip of label is "tip"
show app
